'''Glitch1''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtained from a duplicated [[Batwing]]. Batwing used to be an exclusive Nikilis item however some players managed to get the scythe unknowingly. In late 2016-2018 all of the [[Duping|duplicated]] Batwings were converted into Glitch1’s by [[Nikilis]] (which at the time they were just called “Glitch”). 

== Appearance==
The whole knife uses a white shade, except the handle is slightly darker.

==Trivia== 
*It uses the exact same texture and mesh of the knife [[Whiteout]].
*It is a common misconception that this knife was made in 2018 after people mass duped Batwing. This is incorrect as Glitch1 has been seen in many YouTube videos dating back to late 2016 or early 2017. This can’t possibly be Glitch2 either, as Glitch2 is a gun.
*Unlike Whiteout, Glitch1's picture is straight up and not to the side.
** Another knife with a picture appearance facing straight up is [[Reptile]], though Glitch is tilting to the upper side.
*[https://mm2values.com/v3/?p=home MM2Values] once said that they would never give this knife a [[value]] due to the value changers not believing that this knife should have value since it is just a duplicated [[Batwing]]. However, on October 15th, 2021, this item got a Special Tier on the Commons section and a value.
*As of January 24th, 2023, the name of both Glitches are now renamed to Glitch1 and [[Glitch2]]. Glitch1 is the duplicated [[Batwing|Batwings]] and Glitch2 is the original.
*Supposedly a hacker got a hold of Nikilis' original Batwing and duplicated it and started circulating it. Nikilis later attempted to fix this issue by turning them into "Glitch" and then Nikilis officially released Batwing as an [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]].

